<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Widget test</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/base.css" />
    <style>
      .doc { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 64px; }
      .doc section { max-width: 640px; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .doc p { margin: 6px 0 12px; color: var(--text-2); }
      .doc pre { margin: 0; padding: 12px 14px; overflow: auto; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("partials/nav", { active: "test" }) %>
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Widget test</h1>
      <p>This page stands in for any website. The chat in the corner comes from the script tag below.</p>
    </header>
    <main class="doc">
      <section>
        <h2>Embed</h2>
        <p>With more than one brain, visitors pick one from the menu under the chat title.</p>
        <pre><code>&lt;script src="http://127.0.0.1:3000/widget.js" defer&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Lock to one brain</h2>
        <p>Add <code>data-key</code> to use one brain and hide the menu.</p>
        <pre><code>&lt;script src="http://127.0.0.1:3000/widget.js" data-key="support" defer&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script src="/widget.js" defer></script>
  </body>
</html>
